# (AISLING FX-1) the main area shows the sound from the computer: its state, its level each side and the stream's
# counts; PERFORM's map is as AISLING's. The simulator sends a tone (the right a third of the left) while AMB_FXSTATE
# is 3 or unset; 0, 1 and 2 are the states before sound (run_tests.sh shoots each).
wait 1500
shot main.png
expect helpfit 0
# the home knobs: the filter, the two sends and the dry (0: only the echo and the plate)
spin K4 -100
wait 400
shot dry.png
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
shot perform.png
tap SEL
wait 300
splash 23
shot splash.png
